  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n(1(1)/(3) × 1(4)/(5) ÷ (3)/(5)) × (3)/(8) - (2)/(3)\n\n**Concept used:**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/eafd54de9d9fc295c072d1fa0b8367ee3ed24189b7ad133a51c29266134693c4.png] \n\n**Calculation:**\n\n(1(1)/(3) × 1(4)/(5) ÷ (3)/(5)) × (3)/(8) - (2)/(3)\n\n⇒ ((4)/(3) × (9)/(5) × (5)/(3)) × (3)/(8) - (2)/(3)\n\n⇒ 4 × (3)/(8) - (2)/(3)\n\n⇒ (3)/(2) - (2)/(3)\n\n⇒ (9 - 4)/(6)\n\n⇒ (5)/(6)\n\n**∴ Required answer is (5)/(6).**",
